1. Difference between driver.get() and driver.navigate() commands

* driver.get() is used to open a web page directly by giving the URL.
It is like pasting a URL in the browser and pressing Enter. It loads the page fresh

*driver.navigate() is used when we want to move between pages after already opening a site.
It supports actions like back, forward, refresh, and also navigating to another URL


